  "controls": [
    "Every supplied whole/capture is a half-open BYTE span checked against constructed events; malformed/reversed/out-of-range spans refuse.",
    "Enumerate all permutations of eligible supplied histories per case; both policies keep the same winner; firstDFS does not.",
